  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market scan offshore wind energy Australia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary aim is to conduct a market scan of the offshore wind energy sector in Australia to identify business opportunities for Dutch companies and clarify the legal framework governing this industry in Australia. In the short term, it aims to create a reference point for Dutch businesses, while in the long term, it seeks to align knowledge between Australian and Dutch entities, fostering bilateral exchanges and partnerships in the offshore wind sector.</narrative>
  </description>
